<section class="section-new bg-gray">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="section-label text-center">Common challenges</span>
        <h2 class="text-center">Facing these challenges with cross-border e-commerce?</h2>
        <div class="pain-grid">
            <div class="pain-card">
                <div class="pain-icon"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg></div>
                <p>You want to sell overseas, but don’t know where to start</p>
